invalid type: string "ESS AND MENTAL HEALTH POLICY  \nThe organization supports:  \n• Employee mental well -being  \n• Stress management  \n• Work-life balance  \nEmployees are encouraged to seek help without fear of judgment.  \n \n32. DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION POLICY  \n32.1 Equal Treatment  \nAll employees must be treated equally regardless of:  \n• Gender  \n• Age  \n• Religion  \n��